  ('e_0153', 'p_029', 'mahmoud@givefeedback.dev', 'Podcast invite — the founder story', '<p>I host a small SaaS podcast and loved the widget. Would you come on to talk about going from Loom-chaos to structured feedback?</p>', 'I host a small SaaS podcast and loved the widget. Would you come on to talk about going from Loom-chaos to structured feedback?', '{}', '<e_0153@givefeedback.dev>', 'pass', 'pass', 'pass', 1, (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 5248304), (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 5248304), '[{"email":"owen@givefeedback.dev","name":"Owen Walsh"}]', NULL),
  ('e_0154', 'p_029', 'mahmoud@givefeedback.dev', 'Re: Podcast invite — the founder story', '<p>We run client work for ~30 sites and are evaluating GiveFeedback for all of them. Do you offer team pricing and any client-facing white-labeling?</p><p>A couple of people on our team have brought this up too, so it''s not just me.</p>', 'We run client work for ~30 sites and are evaluating GiveFeedback for all of them. Do you offer team pricing and any client-facing white-labeling?

