  ('e_0158', 'p_030', 'mahmoud@givefeedback.dev', 'Re: Reselling GiveFeedback in our retainers', '<p>We''re ready to go annual but want to confirm session limits are per-project, not per-account. Can you clarify before we sign?</p><p>Let me know the best way to take this forward from here.</p><p>Happy to share more specifics or a quick example if that would help.</p><p>Below is a little more detail on where we''re coming from.</p><p>Thanks in advance — we really appreciate how responsive you''ve been.</p>', 'We''re ready to go annual but want to confirm session limits are per-project, not per-account. Can you clarify before we sign?

