Thanks in advance — we really appreciate how responsive you''ve been.', '{}', '<e_0158@givefeedback.dev>', 'pass', 'pass', 'pass', 1, (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 2996666), (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 2996666), NULL, NULL),
  ('e_0159', 'p_030', 'mahmoud@givefeedback.dev', 'Re: Reselling GiveFeedback in our retainers', '<p>We run a 200-person design meetup in Lisbon next month. Would you give a lightning talk on the feedback-to-tasks workflow?</p><p>Let me know if you need anything else from our side.</p><p>A couple of people on our team have brought this up too, so it''s not just me.</p><p>Happy to hop on a quick call if that''s easier than going back and forth over email.</p><p>I''ve looped in a teammate in case they have more detail than I do.</p>', 'We run a 200-person design meetup in Lisbon next month. Would you give a lightning talk on the feedback-to-tasks workflow?

