  ('e_0500', 'p_097', 'mahmoud@givefeedback.dev', 'Partnership — Webflow marketplace app?', '<p>We maintain a few Webflow apps and think GiveFeedback would be a natural listing. Open to co-building an integration?</p><p>For what it''s worth, we''ve been genuinely impressed with the product so far.</p><p>There''s no real urgency on our side, but I wanted to get it in front of you.</p><p>Below is a little more detail on where we''re coming from.</p><p>Let me know the best way to take this forward from here.</p><p>We''re flexible on timing on our end, so just let us know what works for you.</p>', 'We maintain a few Webflow apps and think GiveFeedback would be a natural listing. Open to co-building an integration?

For what it''s worth, we''ve been genuinely impressed with the product so far.

There''s no real urgency on our side, but I wanted to get it in front of you.

Below is a little more detail on where we''re coming from.

Let me know the best way to take this forward from here.

We''re flexible on timing on our end, so just let us know what works for you.', '{}', '<e_0500@givefeedback.dev>', 'pass', 'pass', 'pass', 1, (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 4852252), (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 4852252), '[{"email":"rosa.garcia@brightfold.co","name":"Rosa Garcia"},{"email":"henry.wayne@forgeworks.dev","name":"Henry Wayne"},{"email":"olivia.prince@meridian.studio","name":"Olivia Prince"}]', NULL),
  ('e_0501', 'p_097', 'mahmoud@givefeedback.dev', 'Re: Partnership — Webflow marketplace app?', '<p>We run a 200-person design meetup in Lisbon next month. Would you give a lightning talk on the feedback-to-tasks workflow?</p><p>Let me know if you need anything else from our side.</p><p>Happy to share more specifics or a quick example if that would help.</p><p>Just so you have the full picture, here''s how this fits into what we''re building.</p>', 'We run a 200-person design meetup in Lisbon next month. Would you give a lightning talk on the feedback-to-tasks workflow?

Let me know if you need anything else from our side.

Happy to share more specifics or a quick example if that would help.

Just so you have the full picture, here''s how this fits into what we''re building.', '{}', '<e_0501@givefeedback.dev>', 'pass', 'pass', 'pass', 1, (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 3590259), (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 3590259), '[{"email":"nadia@givefeedback.dev","name":"Nadia Reyes"},{"email":"priya@givefeedback.dev","name":"Priya Iyer"}]', NULL),
