  ('e_0504', 'p_098', 'marketing@givefeedback.dev', 'Re: Monthly update — small request', '<p>Could the changelog include a screenshot or two per feature? Hard to picture some of them from text alone.</p><p>There''s no real urgency on our side, but I wanted to get it in front of you.</p>', 'Could the changelog include a screenshot or two per feature? Hard to picture some of them from text alone.

