  ('e_0505', 'p_098', 'marketing@givefeedback.dev', 'Re: Re: Monthly update — small request', '<p>Just wanted to say these are actually worth reading. Short, specific, no fluff. Keep them coming.</p><p>Let me know the best way to take this forward from here.</p>', 'Just wanted to say these are actually worth reading. Short, specific, no fluff. Keep them coming.

