  ('e_0506', 'p_098', 'marketing@givefeedback.dev', 'Re: Re: Monthly update — small request', '<p>Saw the API teased at the bottom of the update. Any timeline? We''d like to pull sessions into our own dashboard.</p>', 'Saw the API teased at the bottom of the update. Any timeline? We''d like to pull sessions into our own dashboard.', '{}', '<e_0506@givefeedback.dev>', 'pass', 'pass', 'pass', 1, (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 1808650), (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 1808650), NULL, NULL),
  ('e_0507', 'p_098', 'marketing@givefeedback.dev', 'Re: Re: Monthly update — small request', '<p>Enjoy the product but I''m getting too much email. Please take me off the monthly updates.</p>', 'Enjoy the product but I''m getting too much email. Please take me off the monthly updates.', '{}', '<e_0507@givefeedback.dev>', 'pass', 'pass', 'pass', 1, (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 1258107), (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 1258107), NULL, NULL),
  ('e_0508', 'p_098', 'marketing@givefeedback.dev', 'Re: Re: Monthly update — small request', '<p>Been waiting for this one. Wired it up in five minutes and our devs are thrilled. Thanks for shipping it.</p><p>Happy to share more specifics or a quick example if that would help.</p>', 'Been waiting for this one. Wired it up in five minutes and our devs are thrilled. Thanks for shipping it.

