  ('e_0510', 'p_098', 'projects@givefeedback.dev', 'Re: Review link opened the wrong project', '<p>Could these be batched into one daily summary? We get several a day once a client gets going.</p><p>Happy to hop on a quick call if that''s easier than going back and forth over email.</p><p>I''ve looped in a teammate in case they have more detail than I do.</p><p>A couple of people on our team have brought this up too, so it''s not just me.</p><p>Thanks in advance — we really appreciate how responsive you''ve been.</p>', 'Could these be batched into one daily summary? We get several a day once a client gets going.

Happy to hop on a quick call if that''s easier than going back and forth over email.

I''ve looped in a teammate in case they have more detail than I do.

A couple of people on our team have brought this up too, so it''s not just me.

Thanks in advance — we really appreciate how responsive you''ve been.', '{}', '<e_0510@givefeedback.dev>', 'pass', 'pass', 'pass', 1, (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 2518669), (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 2518669), NULL, NULL),
  ('e_0511', 'p_098', 'projects@givefeedback.dev', 'Re: Review link opened the wrong project', '<p>Got the notification — where do I turn this session into tasks? I see the replay but not the extract button.</p><p>Just so you have the full picture, here''s how this fits into what we''re building.</p>', 'Got the notification — where do I turn this session into tasks? I see the replay but not the extract button.

Just so you have the full picture, here''s how this fits into what we''re building.', '{}', '<e_0511@givefeedback.dev>', 'pass', 'pass', 'pass', 1, (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 2078062), (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 2078062), NULL, NULL),
  ('e_0512', 'p_098', 'projects@givefeedback.dev', 'Re: Review link opened the wrong project', '<p>This is amazing. The replay plus the extracted tasks are exactly what we needed to skip the usual back-and-forth.</p><p>There''s no real urgency on our side, but I wanted to get it in front of you.</p><p>Let me know the best way to take this forward from here.</p><p>Let me know if you need anything else from our side.</p><p>No huge rush, but it would help to have a rough sense of timing.</p>', 'This is amazing. The replay plus the extracted tasks are exactly what we needed to skip the usual back-and-forth.

There''s no real urgency on our side, but I wanted to get it in front of you.

Let me know the best way to take this forward from here.

Let me know if you need anything else from our side.

No huge rush, but it would help to have a rough sense of timing.', '{}', '<e_0512@givefeedback.dev>', 'pass', 'pass', 'pass', 1, (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 1545472), (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 1545472), NULL, NULL),
  ('e_0513', 'p_098', 'projects@givefeedback.dev', 'Re: Review link opened the wrong project', '<p>One of our busier projects is sending a lot of these. Is there a per-project notification toggle?</p>', 'One of our busier projects is sending a lot of these. Is there a per-project notification toggle?', '{}', '<e_0513@givefeedback.dev>', 'pass', 'pass', 'pass', 1, (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 1057155), (CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) - 1057155), NULL, NULL),
