  ('s_0035', 'p_095', 'wei.andersson@sablecreative.co', 'support@givefeedback.dev', 'Re: AI missed half the tasks in a session', '<p>Thanks for reaching out — I''ve looped in the right person on our side. Will follow up shortly with a more concrete answer.</p><p>Happy to hop on a quick call if that''s easier than going back and forth over email.</p><p>Totally open to doing this differently if we''re thinking about it the wrong way.</p><p>No huge rush, but it would help to have a rough sense of timing.</p>', 'Thanks for reaching out — I''ve looped in the right person on our side. Will follow up shortly with a more concrete answer.

